[2026-01-30T09:10:00.445Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01FgGdQmcfrmyhCZijRW6PDw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TNHLciLFjYZUbKsiz9oViw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > direction_content.md << 'DIRECTION_EOF'\n## Vision\nUnify the three parallel Research Service implementations (TypeScript, Python serverless, Python actor) into a single canonical Python implementation with a clean TypeScript client wrapper. This eliminates maintenance burden, ensures consistent behavior, and establishes clear ownership of the research orchestration logic.\n\n## Business Value\n- **Reduced maintenance burden**: Changes to research logic currently require updates in 3 places\n- **Consistent behavior**: Users get identical results regardless of entry point (API, Actor, Serverless)\n- **Faster iteration**: New research features (templates, perspectives) only need implementation once\n- **Simplified debugging**: Single source of truth for research logic makes bug investigation straightforward\n\n## Scope\n**Included:**\n- Consolidate research orchestration to single Python implementation (serverless)\n- Convert TypeScript ResearchService to thin HTTP client calling serverless\n- Unify credibility assessment, cost tracking, and finding extraction\n- Establish shared types/schemas via JSON Schema\n\n**Out of scope:**\n- Template system changes (kept modular)\n- Database schema modifications\n- Frontend/visualization changes\n\n## Key Components\n1. `serverless/src/services/research.py` - Becomes the canonical research orchestrator\n2. `src/lib/research/research-client.ts` - New TypeScript client (replaces research-service.ts)\n3. `shared/schemas/research.json` - Shared JSON Schema for request/response types\n4. `actor/src/services/research.py` - Reduced to serverless client wrapper\n\n## Technical Approach\n1. **Schema-first design**: Define JSON Schema for ResearchRequest, ResearchResult, Finding, Source, Perspective\n2. **Extract shared utilities**: Move credibility assessment, cost calculation to `serverless/src/services/shared/`\n3. **Create TypeScript client**: HTTP client that calls serverless `/research` endpoint with proper typing\n4. **Migrate actor**: Replace actor's research.py with thin wrapper calling serverless\n5. **Add integration tests**: Verify identical outputs across all entry points\n6. **Deprecation path**: Keep TypeScript ResearchService temporarily, log warnings when used directly\n\n## Files to Modify\n- `serverless/src/services/research.py` - Enhance as canonical implementation\n- `src/lib/research/research-service.ts` - Convert to HTTP client\n- `actor/src/services/research.py` - Reduce to serverless client\n- `serverless/src/services/shared/credibility.py` - New shared module\n- `serverless/src/services/shared/cost.py` - New shared module\n- `shared/schemas/research.json` - New shared schema\n\n## Success Criteria\n- [ ] Single Python implementation handles all research orchestration\n- [ ] TypeScript service makes HTTP calls to serverless\n- [ ] Actor makes HTTP calls to serverless\n- [ ] All three entry points produce identical results for same input\n- [ ] No code duplication in credibility/cost logic\n- [ ] Integration tests verify consistency\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- **Latency**: TypeScript calling Python adds HTTP overhead - mitigate with connection pooling and async patterns\n- **Error handling**: HTTP errors need proper mapping to domain errors - implement comprehensive error translation layer\n- **Migration risk**: Existing users of TypeScript service - implement feature flag for gradual rollout\nDIRECTION_EOF\necho \"Written\""}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":592,"cache_read_input_tokens":106181,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":592},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a9084f5-7891-419f-a7ed-a607df0d9f02","uuid":"83272b63-fe21-4b21-870c-e12e3076df03"}
